000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RENEWAL.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT POLICY-FILE ASSIGN TO 'POLICY.DAT'.
000700     SELECT BILL-FILE   ASSIGN TO 'BILLING.RPT'.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
000900 FILE SECTION.
001000 FD POLICY-FILE.
001100 01 POLICY-REC.
001200     05 POL-NUM       PIC 9(6).
001300     05 STATE         PIC XX.
001400     05 AGE           PIC 9(2).
001500     05 VEHICLE       PIC X.
001600     05 CLAIMS        PIC 9(2).
001700     05 BASE-PREM     PIC 9(4)V99.
001800 FD BILL-FILE.
001900 01 BILL-REC          PIC X(60).
002000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002100 01 NEW-PREM          PIC 9(5)V99.
002200 01 TOT-PREM          PIC 9(8)V99  VALUE ZERO.
002300 01 REC-COUNT         PIC 9(4)     VALUE ZERO.
002400 01 EOF-FLAG          PIC X        VALUE 'N'.
002500 01 PREM-ED           PIC Z(5)9.99.
002600 01 TOT-ED            PIC Z(7)9.99.
002700 01 DETAIL-LINE.
002800     05 FILLER        PIC X(8)  VALUE 'POLICY  '.
002900     05 DL-POL        PIC 9(6).
003000     05 FILLER        PIC X(10) VALUE '  PREMIUM '.
003100     05 DL-PREM       PIC Z(5)9.99.
003200     05 FILLER        PIC X(27) VALUE SPACES.
003300 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003400 MAIN-PARA.
003500     OPEN INPUT POLICY-FILE.
003600     OPEN OUTPUT BILL-FILE.
003700     PERFORM READ-REC.
003800     PERFORM PROCESS-REC UNTIL EOF-FLAG = 'Y'.
003900     PERFORM WRITE-TOTALS.
004000     CLOSE POLICY-FILE.
004100     CLOSE BILL-FILE.
004200     STOP RUN.
004300 READ-REC.
004400     READ POLICY-FILE
004500         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO EOF-FLAG.
004600 PROCESS-REC.
004700     PERFORM CALC-PREM.
004800     ADD 1 TO REC-COUNT.
004900     ADD NEW-PREM TO TOT-PREM.
005000     MOVE POL-NUM  TO DL-POL.
005100     MOVE NEW-PREM TO DL-PREM.
005200     WRITE BILL-REC FROM DETAIL-LINE.
005300     MOVE NEW-PREM TO PREM-ED.
005400     DISPLAY POL-NUM ' ' PREM-ED.
005500     PERFORM READ-REC.
005600 CALC-PREM.
005700     MOVE BASE-PREM TO NEW-PREM.
005800     IF AGE > 50
005900         ADD 25 TO NEW-PREM.
006000     IF CLAIMS > 0
006100         COMPUTE NEW-PREM = NEW-PREM + (CLAIMS * 50).
006200 WRITE-TOTALS.
006300     MOVE TOT-PREM TO TOT-ED.
006400     DISPLAY 'RECORDS ' REC-COUNT ' TOTAL ' TOT-ED.
